Comment:
 This package ships three kinds of work, and they are attributed separately
 below.
 .
 Zenith's own code — the control tool, the session, and the Quickshell
 configuration Zenith writes — is GPL-3.0-or-later.
 .
 The shell's configuration is a vendored copy of two upstream components,
 redistributed unmodified and each pinned to a commit: end-4's "ii"
 configuration (GPL-3.0-only) and the rounded-polygon-qmljs submodule it
 carries (Apache-2.0). Every vendored file is byte-identical to the commit
 named above, and `zenith doctor` checks the installed tree against
 /usr/share/zenith/shell/vendor/manifest.yaml, which records the pins, the
 licence and the copyright line of each component. The same facts are written
 out for a reader in /usr/share/doc/zenith/vendor-manifest.md.
 .
 The SPDX identifiers of the licences used here are GPL-3.0-or-later, GPL-3.0-only
 and Apache-2.0.

